  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1140/700/arsenal_full_1000-png.png\" alt=\"Arsenal\"></p><h2>🗡️ 來自過往的傳奇武器 - 非經鍛造，而是征服所得</h2><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ffabricmc.net%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Loader-Fabric | NeoForge-ecebe6?labelColor=263768&amp;style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"模組載入器\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/spell-engine\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Ecosystem-法術引擎-orange?style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"SpellEngine\"></a> <a href=\"https://discord.gg/KN9b3pjFTM\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/973561601519149057.svg?label=&amp;logo=discord&amp;logoColor=ffffff&amp;color=7389D8&amp;labelColor=6A7EC2&amp;style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"Discord\"></a></p><hr><h2>✨ 探索更多RPG系列作品</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/archers\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/755/169/archers_full_275.png\" alt=\"弓箭手\"></a></th>\n<th><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/paladins-and-priests\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/755/170/paladins_full_275.png\" alt=\"聖騎士\"></a></th>\n<th><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/wizards\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/755/171/wizards_full_275.png\" alt=\"巫師\"></a></th>\n<th><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/rogues-and-warriors\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/899/332/rogues_full_bg_275.png\" alt=\"盜賊\"></a></th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/skill-tree\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1311/865/skilltree_275-png.png\" alt=\"技能樹\"></a></td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/jewelry\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/760/387/jewelry_full_275.png\" alt=\"珠寶\"></a></td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/relics-rpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1103/296/relics_275-png.png\" alt=\"聖物\"></a></td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/armory-rpg-series\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1311/866/armory_275-png.png\" alt=\"軍械庫\"></a></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table><h1>📦 安裝說明</h1><h3>必要項目</h3><ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/spell-engine\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">法術引擎</a> &nbsp;</li>\n</ul><h1>🗡️ 特色功能</h1><h2>40+ 種史詩武器，涵蓋15種不同類型</h2><ul>\n<li>所有武器至少內建一種被動法術</li>\n<li>美術風格承襲《Minecraft Dungeons》</li>\n<li>內容靈感源自《魔獸世界》經典元素</li>\n</ul><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1141/731/sword-gif.gif\" alt=\"物品\"></th>\n<th><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1141/728/hammer-gif.gif\" alt=\"物品\"></th>\n<th><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1141/727/damage_staff-gif.gif\" alt=\"物品\"></th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1141/730/shield-gif.gif\" alt=\"物品\"></td>\n<td><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1141/726/bow-gif.gif\" alt=\"物品\"></td>\n<td><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1141/729/healing_staff-gif.gif\" alt=\"物品\"></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1141/866/fight_1-png.png\" alt=\"輝光\"></p><h2>20+ 種被動法術</h2><ul>\n<li>機制靈感來自《Minecraft Dungeons》（部分為精準復刻：旋風斬、震地波、輝光…）</li>\n<li>涵蓋所有職業類型的法術（近戰法術、弓箭法術、魔法傷害法術…）</li>\n</ul><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1141/832/apol_gimped-png.png\" alt=\"替代文字\"></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1141/835/staff_gimped-png.png\" alt=\"替代文字\"></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1141/833/crossbow_gimped-png.png\" alt=\"替代文字\"></p><h2>僅可透過戰利品獲得</h2><ul>\n<li>由首領掉落（終界龍、凋零怪、幽匿感測體，以及第三方模組首領）</li>\n<li>藏於終局地牢寶箱中（如終界城寶箱）</li>\n</ul><p>戰利品表注入設定可於 <code>config/rpg_series/loot_items.json</code> 中調整。軍械庫武器列於第5級武器標籤下。</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1141/834/dragon_drop-png.png\" alt=\"替代文字\"></p><h1>專為多人遊戲設計</h1><p>打造專屬的RPG伺服器。使用我們的推廣代碼可享優惠價格，同時支持我們。</p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fRPG_SERIES\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/partners/custom-banners/88e9c178-fe70-4122-8b9b-97d2feb48c2a.png\" alt=\"取得伺服器\"></a></p><h1>🎁 尋找更多內容？</h1><p>探索由我們合作夥伴製作的各式法術引擎模組！</p><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/rpg-minibosses-forsaken-adventurers\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1358/177/anarchy-png.png\" alt=\"無政府\"></a></th>\n<th><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mercenaries-and-artificers\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1346/857/merc_275-png.png\" alt=\"傭兵與工匠\"></a></th>\n<th><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/archers-expansion\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1346/945/archers_expansion_275-png.png\" alt=\"弓箭手擴展（更多RPG職業）\"></a></th>\n<th><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/berserker-rpg-class\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1346/946/berserker_mod_275-png.png\" alt=\"狂戰士（更多RPG職業）\"></a></th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/elemental-wizards-rpg-class\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1346/947/elemental_wizards_275-png.png\" alt=\"元素巫師（更多RPG職業）\"></a></td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/forcemaster-rpg-class\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1346/948/forcemaster_275-png.png\" alt=\"原力大師（更多RPG職業）\"></a></td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/witcher-rpg-class\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1346/949/witcher_mod_275-png.png\" alt=\"獵魔士（更多RPG職業）\"></a></td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/death-knights\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/953/998/death_knights_275_2.png\" alt=\"死亡騎士\"></a></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>",
